生动，象征滋养和高端护理的氛围。这种液体设计犹如金色之水，与产品主题紧密相关。\n\n整体画面富有层次感，构图平衡且设计细腻，每一部分元素都紧密围绕产品的核心诉求，展现出富有吸引力的视觉效果。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 25, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [25, 32, 33], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [273.4160461425781, 152.15707397460938], "pos": [1773.5205078125, 1281.9949951171875], "widgets_values": ["Please provide a detailed description of this image. If any characters in the image are familiar to you, such as celebrities, movie characters, or animated figures, please directly use their names. The description should be as detailed as possible, but should not exceed 200 words."], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 36, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 34, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 34, "type": "RH_Captioner", "title": "Runninghub Captioner-反推", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#332922", "shape": 2, "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 3, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [458.57183837890625, 643.7847290039062], "pos": [2010.6102294921875, 274.75775146484375], "id": 3, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.48", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [{"name": 